      "en": "Employer sickness insurance contributions rate (from 2019: income > 2.5 SMIC )"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tscersi_rate"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the employer sickness (health) insurance contribution rate of 13%, applied to whole gross income for employees earning above the relevant SMIC multiple threshold (2.25 SMIC from 2025, previously 2.5 SMIC). It is used in tscer_fr's ArithOp function (Formula parameter, 'Sickness insurance contributions') and BenCalc (Comp_perTU parameter) to compute the higher-earner sickness contribution, which is eligible for the general reduction on low-wage employer contributions."
    },
